WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:10.600
It's a Dark Synchro monster!

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.990
The opponent can't activate spells or 
traps until the end of the Damage Step.

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.870
He activated the Field Spell!

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:27.530
He now has everything he needs 
to summon an Earthbound Immortal!

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:29.170
Lua!

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:32.410
Due to the Field Spell 
Closed Forest's effect,

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.490
Zeman the Ape King gains 100 attack points 
for every monster in my graveyard.

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:42.820
There are five monsters in my graveyard.

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:52.560
3000 attack points?

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:10.700
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:15.800
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:20.710
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:25.480
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:30.840
No matter how bad today is

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:35.830
There's still the faintest light

00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:41.230
All I have to do tomorrow

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:45.290
Is light it myself

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:50.300
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:55.270
Even if I get countless scars

00:01:55.770 --> 00:02:01.570
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:05.550
Today will never exist again

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:11.450
So I won't stop or vanish

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:40.420
The King That Rules MinusZeman the Ape King

00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:52.940
Regulus, I can't believe you continued to 
fight alone even though you're badly hurt.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:56.250
Don't be scared.  We won't hurt you.

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:00.370
Please stop!

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:05.530
This child came from an alternate 
world to rescue Ancient Fairy Dragon.

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:06.660
What?

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:09.150
It's true, so please calm down.

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:11.140
Stop messing around!

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:16.270
It's no good.  Let's flee for now!

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:17.750
Please believe me!

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:22.210
I promised Ancient Fairy Dragon that 
I would protect the spirit world!

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:23.820
Just like I thought!

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:29.040
You want to capture me so that you can use 
Ancient Fairy Dragon's power for evil.

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:32.690
We're failing to communicate.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.560
Torunka, look at that!

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.240
That's a cursed needle!

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:40.530
The needle is pointing towards minus.

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:44.720
That means he hears the 
opposite of what we say!

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:49.030
Oh no!  That's why Regulus was going crazy!

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:52.710
You villains are harming the spirit world!

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:54.700
I'll stop you!

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:55.910
It's a misunderstanding, Regulus!

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:58.150
I'm not your enemy!

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.620
That's right, Regulus!

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:05.590
We conquered the spirit world!

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:15.340
Torunka, you're a spellcaster!  
Can't you do anything?

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:18.330
It's impossible.  As long as I'm 
a child, I can't use spells.

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:19.310
What should we do?

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:25.240
I have a good idea!  If 
Regulus hears the opposite...

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:29.210
I really hate you!

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:31.050
Regulus, you're an idiot!

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:33.450
You're an ugly lion!  You're a fraidy cat!

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:41.400
Did you really think flattery would work?

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:43.040
I failed!

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:45.720
I wonder how it sounded…

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:52.900
I have to find a way to move the 
minus needle back to normal.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.640
Someone's coming.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.040
There he is!

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.110
Over there!

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:05.320
It's you again!

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:08.310
We finally found you.

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:12.000
By Zeman's orders, we'll 
capture you this time!

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:22.190
Become minus!

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:23.390
You fool!  Don't do it!

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:27.510
Did you forget that he has a 
minus cursed needle in his leg?

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:32.830
Oh yeah.  If two minuses touch, it 
changes into powerful plus energy.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:39.000
He's escaping!

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:39.980
After him!

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:49.040
If two minuses touch, then it 
changes into powerful plus energy!

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:50.260
Luca!

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:52.250
Wait up!

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:57.630
We lost him.

00:05:57.630 --> 00:06:00.910
He couldn't have gone 
far.  Split up and search!

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:14.060
Try to catch me!

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:18.160
You're that girl from Shubank 
City!  Why are you here?

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:19.700
Torunka, now!

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:20.670
Right!

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:33.170
We can use this.

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:34.770
That worked great!

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.660
They're no longer after me.

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:49.790
Regulus!

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:08.980
Regulus, listen to my real voice!

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:11.910
Let's rescue Ancient Fairy Dragon together!

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:15.150
Stop!  If you come any 
closer, I'll take you down!

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:24.360
Regulus, if you don't want Ancient Fairy 
Dragon to die, then you'll obey us!

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:28.030
Luca!

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:42.610
Let's battle.  Zeman the Ape 
King attacks Power Tool Dragon.

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:44.410
Cursed Flare!

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:47.680
Power Tool Dragon's effect!

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:52.200
By sending the equipped Break! Draw! to 
the graveyard, the destruction is negated!

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:54.180
But you still take damage.

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:05.130
Power Tool Dragon is protecting me.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.050
Lua!

00:08:07.060 --> 00:08:09.830
I'll also protect her.

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:12.340
Luca!

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:17.310
Luca!

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:18.410
Torunka!

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:19.770
Luca!

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:20.970
Lua?

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:23.380
Lua is also fighting.

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:25.750
Regulus!

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:32.060
That's the mark of a Signer!

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:35.600
It's a waterfall!

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:36.700
Regulus!

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:10.060
I thought I was going to die.

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:12.060
Regulus, are you okay?

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:14.060
We finally meet.

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:31.060
Signer, I was waiting for 
you to come to this world.

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:33.750
Regulus!

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:38.200
Lua!

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:39.260
Are you okay?

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:42.110
Power Tool Dragon, are you okay?

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:46.830
You somehow managed to survive.

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:49.440
I set two cards.

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:51.080
I end my turn.

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:54.000
The real battle is only beginning!

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.700
My turn.  I draw!

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:03.510
I have to find a way to get a card 
that will defeat Zeman the Ape King.

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:07.440
Power Tool Dragon's effect activates!

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:10.680
I add a random Equip Spell 
in my deck to my hand.

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:13.360
Please let me draw it!

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:20.300
Megamorph!  All right!

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:24.340
I equip the Equip Spell Megamorph 
on Power Tool Dragon!

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:28.250
How's that?  Power Tool Dragon's 
attack points are doubled-

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:32.010
Huh?  Its attack points didn't change.  Why?

00:10:32.010 --> 00:10:33.110
You fool!

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:36.580
Megamorph doubles the equipped 
monster's attack points

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:39.580
when you have less life points than me.

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:43.850
Right now, our life points are 
equal.  The effect doesn't activate.

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:46.190
Oh no!

00:10:46.190 --> 00:10:49.570
This would've been an incredible combo 
that would've turned the tables,

00:10:49.570 --> 00:10:51.570
but I don't have any strategies left!

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:56.860
Destiny doesn't smile upon non-Signers.

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:57.550
Lua!

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:05.240
Don't forget that you have cards 
in your deck that you trust!

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:09.480
If you believe in your cards, 
then the cards will answer you!

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:14.450
You must believe!  Your 
cards will not betray you!

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:16.450
Yusei…

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:19.550
That's right!

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:25.060
Power Tool Dragon can negate its destruction 
by sending its Equip Spell to the graveyard.

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:29.970
I switch Power Tool Dragon to 
defense position and end my turn.

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:34.720
Focusing on defense in a shadow 
duel is a foolish maneuver.

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:39.440
As Yusei suggested, I'll believe in 
my cards and wait for an opportunity.

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:57.960
Regulus, you're the one who 
brought me to this world?

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:02.860
Yes.  I heard about you 
from Ancient Fairy Dragon.

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:07.440
As I continued to battle, I used my abilities

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:11.940
to cast a spell that would 
guide you to the spirit world.

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:14.190
Please forgive me.

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:16.520
Even though the curse confused me,

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:19.820
it doesn't change the fact that I 
believed that you were the enemy.

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:24.510
Totally!  I thought you were 
going to eat me, Regulus.

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:25.580
It's fine now.

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:29.830
When we were falling down 
the waterfall, he saved us.

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:31.560
Thank you, Regulus.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:38.540
Let's rescue Ancient Fairy Dragon.

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:44.180
Zeman the Ape King's curse sealed 
Ancient Fairy Dragon in a mountain.

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:48.020
If we invade Zeman's castle and 
defeat him, we will break his curse.

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:51.830
Then the ones who have become 
minus will return to normal.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:54.250
Get on my back.

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:55.920
Torunka.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:56.790
Right!

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:02.340
Hold on tight.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:31.090
The sky, the land, the flow 
of time in the spirit world!

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:35.390
I am the great conqueror Zeman the Ape King!

00:13:35.930 --> 00:13:42.310
I'll turn everything in the world 
into minus and make it mine!

00:14:03.890 --> 00:14:05.130
What's wrong, Regulus?

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:06.610
Luca, look at that!

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:13.320
There's something wrong with the sun.

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:18.540
That's…

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:27.440
What's going on?

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:51.430
Nature is reverting into a primeval world.

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:55.930
This is bad!  The spirits 
will no longer have a home!

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:01.090
What's wrong, Torunka?  
Your clothes are baggy.

00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:04.480
No, my body has shrunk again.

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:10.500
At this rate, Luca and I will 
turn into babies and vanish!

00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:11.700
Oh no!

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:13.780
We don't have a moment to waste!

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:17.460
We have to defeat Zeman 
while we can still fight!

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:18.780
Let's hurry, Luca!

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:27.410
Lua, lend me your strength!

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:30.300
The strength to fight Zeman the Ape King!

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:35.490
My turn.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:41.950
Let's battle!  Zeman the Ape 
King attacks Power Tool Dragon.

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:43.300
Cursed Flare!

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:46.290
Bring it on!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:50.330
Power Tool Dragon is in defense position, 
and its Equip Spell will be its shield!

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:54.660
It's pointless.  I activate the 
Continuous Trap Roaring Earth!

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:58.750
When a Beast-Type monster attacks 
a monster in defense position,

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:00.340
you take piercing damage!

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:12.380
By sending Power Tool Dragon's Equip Spell 
to the graveyard, its destruction is negated.

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:23.370
Power Tool Dragon is hurt!  Why?

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:31.360
Due to Roaring Earth's effect, your monster 
loses 300 attack and defense points.

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:32.240
What?

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:37.940
I set one card and end my turn.

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:40.990
How pathetic.

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:46.080
You and your monsters remain 
on the field looking miserable.

00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:51.820
Power Tool Dragon, thank you.

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:56.060
No matter how hurt you 
are, you still protect me.

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:03.280
So no matter how lame I look, 
I'll still protect Luca!

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:24.620
Zeman the Ape King is there.

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:27.670
There's heavy security.

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:31.570
Yes.  If we're not careful, 
they'll capture us.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:33.180
What should we do?

00:17:33.590 --> 00:17:36.670
There's only one way to 
infiltrate the castle.

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:40.450
What?

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.570
Regulus has finally been captured?

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:45.260
Well done!

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:50.270
With Regulus, we can completely transform 
Ancient Fairy Dragon into minus.

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:53.820
But it wasn't the retrieval 
squad who caught him.

00:17:54.360 --> 00:17:56.060
Who did?

00:17:56.060 --> 00:17:59.020
A wandering spellcaster.

00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:01.500
A wandering spellcaster?

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:13.520
Thank you!

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:25.040
Great Zeman the Ape King, 
it is an honor to meet you.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.580
An honor.

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:29.580
Raise your heads.

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:35.490
That's Zeman the Ape King.

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:40.730
Kuribon!

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:45.440
Sunny Pixie!  And Sunlight Unicorn!

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.900
Everyone, I'll rescue you.

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:53.810
I hear that you're a wandering spellcaster?

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:54.820
Yes.

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.360
I'm the apprentice.

00:18:56.980 --> 00:19:03.450
How did you capture Regulus 
when my squads couldn't?

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:12.070
The power to control the 
spirits, come to my hand.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:14.060
Awaken!

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:19.370
Calm down!

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:26.800
You control him so easily.

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:28.180
Of course!

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:32.370
My master's spells can control any 
spirit, no matter how wild he is!

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:36.020
I don't believe you.  Are 
you really using a spell?

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:38.660
Do you doubt me?

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:43.010
Then I'll have Regulus attack those soldiers.

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:47.730
That's enough.  As long as 
I have Regulus, that's fine.

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:50.060
I will turn him into minus immediately.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:54.240
Please wait, Zeman.

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:55.840
What is it?

00:19:55.840 --> 00:20:02.240
If you force the minus curse on 
him, then my spell will be removed.

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:05.100
If that happens, Regulus will 
be out-of-control again.

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.850
So what do you want me to do?

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:10.990
There's no point in keeping him 
in a cage and performing tricks.

00:20:10.990 --> 00:20:16.790
With all due respect, I don't think you 
know how to transform Regulus into minus.

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:18.760
What do you mean?

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:23.760
Do you know that Regulus is 
Ancient Fairy Dragon's servant?

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:25.400
I do.

00:20:25.400 --> 00:20:29.210
Ancient Fairy Dragon is 
sealed inside a mountain,

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:33.210
but I'm having trouble because I'm unable 
to completely transform it into minus.

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:35.210
Then this won't take long.

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:38.480
If you temporarily remove 
Ancient Fairy Dragon's seal,

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:41.480
and I cast a curse on 
Regulus at the same time,

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:45.960
they will both turn completely 
minus and belong to you, Zeman.

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:49.930
Remove the seal on Ancient Fairy Dragon?

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:53.400
Yes.  There is no other way.

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:11.750
Fine.  I trust you.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:13.800
You did it!

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:15.000
Shh, stay quiet.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:20.920
Come to me, Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:21:43.770 --> 00:21:45.520
Ancient Fairy...

00:21:57.880 --> 00:22:02.350
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:02.710 --> 00:22:07.420
We will build our own future

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:12.860
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:13.320 --> 00:22:18.030
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:23.630 --> 00:22:33.170
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:33.600 --> 00:22:38.740
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:38.810 --> 00:22:43.450
Even if it loses its light

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:48.720
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:53.190
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:53.390 --> 00:22:58.770
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:58.900 --> 00:23:03.580
This journey has no end

00:23:03.870 --> 00:23:09.110
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:14.350
Hear my voice
